---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Nationwide Permitting Process for Multi-Site Commercial Projects" description="Burnham Nationwide manages multi-site expansion permits for national retailers, financial institutions, schools and restaurants, with one project manager and local research in every municipality." nav="learn">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Learn</li><li>Nationwide permits</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#research">Research</a><a href="#project-management">Project management</a><a href="#burnham-touch">The Burnham touch</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Nationwide permitting process</div>
        <h1 class="h-display">Permits in every market, <span class="hl-block">one partner.</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">Burnham Nationwide is the recognized name in multi-site expansion permit management. We secure every permit and approval major corporations need to open new locations across the country, and have grown this practice over several decades.</p>
        <div class="row">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a rollout</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/what-we-do/permit-management/">Permit management services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/mbr.jpg" alt="Architectural floor plan with a pen and scale ruler"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--deep section--tight" aria-label="Overall reach">
    <div class="wrap stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">8</div><div class="stat__label">cities where our offices are anchored</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">3,000</div><div class="stat__label">cities worked in across the country</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__value">40,000</div><div class="stat__label">multi-site permits pulled</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Industry leadership</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Local requirements, researched before you commit.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Our in-house research team stays current on local code and permitting requirements and delivers due diligence reports that set out every step to permit in each municipality.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <h3 class="h-sm">National permit rollouts for</h3>
        <ul class="tags">
          <li class="tag">National retailers</li>
          <li class="tag">Financial institutions</li>
          <li class="tag">Educational facilities</li>
          <li class="tag">Hospitality &amp; restaurants</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="callout">
          <div class="callout__title">One point of contact</div>
          <div class="callout__body">Work with one company to manage every permit nationwide. The same project manager stays with you for the life of the program.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">How a rollout runs</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Research, manage, adapt.</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step" id="research"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3>Research</h3><p>We review and analyze as many proposed preliminary projects as you bring us, then present anticipated results for municipalities across the country. Ruling out sites that won’t work saves time early, and our current knowledge of local code and permitting requirements lets us build your construction schedule around each municipality’s practices and expectations.</p></div></li>
        <li class="step" id="project-management"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3>Project management</h3><p>One project manager works with you for the entire life cycle and is available for questions and updates by phone, email or in person. Our systematic approach includes confirming every required local fee, and every document is archived and tracked in a secure database that files to municipal online portals anywhere in the nation.</p></div></li>
        <li class="step" id="burnham-touch"><span class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3>The Burnham touch</h3><p>Major expansions demand thorough planning, precise scheduling and close coordination, and filing requirements vary by jurisdiction. As your single point of contact, we adapt quickly to changing requirements or unexpected requests, such as zoning variances, without delaying the schedule.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Trusted by</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Fortune 500 companies and leading development and architecture firms.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="body">For more than two decades, Burnham project managers have obtained the permits and approvals complex construction programs require, handling communication with regulators, design teams and construction firms along the way. See how that works in practice in our <a class="link" href="/portfolio/">project portfolio</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--flush-top">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Planning a multi-site expansion?</h2>
        <p>Share your site list and timeline. We’ll review the markets and come back with a permitting plan.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Connect with our team</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
